# sabotage=MovedBodiesAreNotAnnounced: the pass moves the body of a function into another one and tells nobody. The listener goes with the body, so the old body would be compared with whatever stands in its place: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass SplitBehindEntryChecks
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=MovedBodiesAreNotAnnounced
# PROGRAM-OF: moved-bodies-are-not-announced-left-alone.ir
